        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👁️Spectator has returned!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Spectator 3</strong>—the next chapter in the anomaly-spotting psychological horror series. It's a brand-new descent into paranoia. <strong>Spectator 3</strong> amplifies everything — the fear, the mystery, the horror.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌀 <strong>What You See Can Hurt You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Spectator. Behind a wall of flickering screens, you must detect the undetectable — things that <i>shouldn’t</i> be. A painting changed. A figure moved. A whisper that leaves no echo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss one… and it spreads.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕵️‍♀️ <strong>New Features Include:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A NEW LEVEL OF DREAD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Security feeds from even more twisted environments. The anomalies are smarter, bolder—and now, some of them <strong>know you're watching</strong>. Your perception is your last line of defense. Use it wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DYNAMIC ANOMALY SYSTEM<br><strong>No two playthroughs are alike.</strong> Every session is procedurally haunted with layers of randomized, reactive phenomena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEEPER HORROR, DARKER LORE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expanded narrative weaves throughout every camera feed. Cryptic messages, recurring figures, and overlapping timelines hint at a hidden truth. Can you piece it together before everything breaks?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectator 3 </strong>isn't just about spotting what's wrong.<br>It's about questioning what’s right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👁️Spectator has returned!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Spectator 3</strong>—the next chapter in the anomaly-spotting psychological horror series. It's a brand-new descent into paranoia. <strong>Spectator 3</strong> amplifies everything — the fear, the mystery, the horror.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌀 <strong>What You See Can Hurt You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Spectator. Behind a wall of flickering screens, you must detect the undetectable — things that <i>shouldn’t</i> be. A painting changed. A figure moved. A whisper that leaves no echo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss one… and it spreads.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕵️‍♀️ <strong>New Features Include:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A NEW LEVEL OF DREAD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Security feeds from even more twisted environments. The anomalies are smarter, bolder—and now, some of them <strong>know you're watching</strong>. Your perception is your last line of defense. Use it wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DYNAMIC ANOMALY SYSTEM<br><strong>No two playthroughs are alike.</strong> Every session is procedurally haunted with layers of randomized, reactive phenomena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEEPER HORROR, DARKER LORE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expanded narrative weaves throughout every camera feed. Cryptic messages, recurring figures, and overlapping timelines hint at a hidden truth. Can you piece it together before everything breaks?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectator 3 </strong>isn't just about spotting what's wrong.<br>It's about questioning what’s right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
